# REQUIRES: python-api, cuda
# Device-resident buffers of a persistent simulation on a GPU
# (D215), scenario threads of Inputs/python_resident.py.
# An activation of the entry resumed on Python threads other than the one
# it began on gives the state of a run on one thread to the bit.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_resident.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU threads | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: Double, Execution.threads 1: parts on three Python threads give the state of one, to the bit
# CHECK: Mixed, Execution.threads 1: parts on three Python threads give the state of one, to the bit
# CHECK: resident threads passed
